  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2306.01 Vessel Manufacturer or Dealer Registration Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2306.01 Vessel Manufacturer or Dealer Registration Applications.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 270-E:13, a vessel manufacturer or dealer may apply for a general distinguishing number for their vessels.\n\n(b) In order to apply for a general distinguishing number, a manufacturer or dealer shall furnish the following to the department:\n\n(1) Corporate name and federal identification number of the manufacturer's or dealer's business;\n\n(2) Trade name and federal identification number, if applicable;\n\n(3) Whether the application is an original or renewal;\n\n(4) Legal address;\n\n(5) Mailing address;\n\n(6) Telephone number;\n\n(7) Business hours;\n\n(8) Name, address, and date of birth of at least one owner, partner, or officer, and title;\n\n(9) Whether the manufacturer or dealer:\n\na. Holds a franchise, and if so, the name of the franchise;\n\nb. Furnishes repair service;\n\nc. Has complied with all local zoning and regulatory requirements;\n\nd. Agrees to notify the department of any change of address or corporate or trade name; and\n\ne. Is principally engaged in buying, selling, or manufacturing new or used vessels, or both;\n\n(10) If a renewal:\n\na. A list of all vessel numbers issued to the manufacturer or dealer by the department; and\n\nb. Whether a change in ownership or location has occurred; and\n\n(11) Signature of the person listed in (8) above and date signed.\n\n(c) A general distinguishing number shall be used by a manufacturer or dealer pursuant to RSA 270-E:13, II.\n\n(d) For the purposes of (b)(10)a. above, the list shall be provided in numerical and alphabetical sequence.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss and moved by #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2303.01) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
